   2535  ff0f							; Tally entry tramp slice ($FFE6-$FFEB) — byte-identical with kernel.asm's
   2536  ff0f							; copy at the same address (F6 pad rule). bank0 executes `sta $1FF7` at
   2537  ff0f							; $FFE6-$FFE8; the fetch at $FFE9 comes from THIS bank = `jmp TallyEntry`
   2538  ff0f							; ($F44F — moved here from bank2, repack chunk 3, 2026-10-20). Neither bank
   2539  ff0f							; runs its other half. $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (hotspot mirrors).
